flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> INPUT[/Policy question and request credentials/]
    INPUT --> FRAMEWORK[[Resolve identity and validate request schema]]
    FRAMEWORK --> VALID{Identity and payload accepted?}
    VALID -->|False| REJECT[/Safe authentication or validation error/]
    REJECT --> CLEANUP[[Close request session if opened]]
    VALID -->|True| ACTOR{Legacy user ID absent or matches actor?}
    ACTOR -->|False| FORBIDDEN[/403 identity mismatch/]
    FORBIDDEN --> CLEANUP
    ACTOR -->|True| USER[Load application user]
    USER --> EXISTS{User exists?}
    EXISTS -->|False| MISSING[/404 user not found/]
    MISSING --> CLEANUP
    EXISTS -->|True| CLASSIFY[[Protect text and classify reported event]]
    CLASSIFY -->|Unsafe input| UNSAFE[/422 safe input rejection/]
    UNSAFE --> CLEANUP
    CLASSIFY --> INCIDENT{Potential incident?}
    INCIDENT -->|True| SAFETY[/200 incident guidance; no automatic report or email/]
    SAFETY --> CLEANUP
    INCIDENT -->|False| STAGE[Stage conversation and user message]
    STAGE --> SEARCH[[Query top three current approved policy versions]]
    SEARCH --> POLICYDB[(PostgreSQL policies and policy versions)]
    POLICYDB --> SCORE{Results exist AND top score at least 0.22?}
    SCORE -->|False| OWNER[Choose top policy owner if available; otherwise triage]
    SCORE -->|True| KEYWORDS{Substantive keywords AND matching evidence?}
    KEYWORDS -->|False| OWNER
    KEYWORDS -->|True| CONTEXT[Build context from results meeting threshold]
    CONTEXT --> REWRITE[[Attempt optional AI rewrite]]
    REWRITE --> USABLE{Usable AI answer returned?}
    USABLE -->|True| ANSWER[Use rewrite with appended policy reference]
    USABLE -->|False| FALLBACK[Use deterministic guidance with policy reference]
    ANSWER --> SAVEANSWER[Save assistant message and citations; commit]
    FALLBACK --> SAVEANSWER
    SAVEANSWER --> ANSWERDB[(Conversation messages and citations)]
    ANSWERDB --> GUIDANCE[/200 answer and IDs; clarification false/]
    GUIDANCE --> CLEANUP
    OWNER --> SAVECLARIFY[Save uncertainty answer; clarification; read watermark; commit]
    SAVECLARIFY --> CLARIFYDB[(Conversation and clarification records)]
    CLARIFYDB --> CLARIFICATION[/200 clarification IDs; triage iff no assignee/]
    CLARIFICATION --> CLEANUP
    USER -->|Unhandled database error| ERROR[/500 generic error with request ID/]
    STAGE -->|Unhandled persistence error| ERROR
    SEARCH -->|Unhandled database error| ERROR
    SAVEANSWER -->|Unhandled persistence error| ERROR
    SAVECLARIFY -->|Unhandled persistence error| ERROR
    ERROR --> CLEANUP
    CLEANUP --> STOP([Stop])
